. scripts for RUN / LOAD (name.s)
demo.s spec example: BOOT short = hexagon, double = end, tap prints
shapes.s library: drawPoly n cx cy r
count.s counts with WAIT 500 (STOP / PAUSE / STEP tests)
ask.s INPUT and a TIMER
rec.s IMU REC for STOP NOW
hang.s endless loop: copy over SD:/sys/onBoot.s to test the BOOT escape
dbg.s BPT! with no client: copy over SD:/sys/onBoot.s (USB console)
data APPEND / LOGCAT files
DESCRIPT.ION file descriptions for this folder
